{
  "appid": 247080,
  "name": "Crypt of the NecroDancer",
  "type": "game",
  "short_description": "《节奏地牢》是一款屡获殊荣的硬核地牢探险节奏游戏。你能攻克险象环生的狂舞地牢、斩杀死灵舞者，夺回自己仍在搏动的心脏吗？还是说，你会永生永世沦为节拍的奴隶？玩家将跟随节奏移动，探索随机生成的地牢，伴着 Danny Baranowsky 创作的精彩原声，大战狂舞的骷髅、僵尸、巨龙等强敌！还可以和好友本地合作，组队攻关.",
  "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/247080/extras/1e8b81c67b6be30799f9bb09d3351eb7.poster.avif?t=1781119569\" width=600 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/247080/extras/1e8b81c67b6be30799f9bb09d3351eb7.webm?t=1781119569\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/247080/extras/1e8b81c67b6be30799f9bb09d3351eb7.mp4?t=1781119569\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >伴着节奏，揍翻敌人！</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >《节奏地牢》是一款屡获殊荣的硬核 Roguelike 节奏游戏。踩着节奏，探索变幻的地牢，大战狂舞的骷髅、僵尸、巨龙等强敌。伴着 Danny Baranowsky 创作的超抓耳原声舞动，还可自行导入你所珍藏的 MP3！</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/247080/extras/951a978b9a49af3c74498a2d6a28519f.poster.avif?t=1781119569\" width=600 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/247080/extras/951a978b9a49af3c74498a2d6a28519f.webm?t=1781119569\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/247080/extras/951a978b9a49af3c74498a2d6a28519f.mp4?t=1781119569\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >游戏特色：</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >可使用多达 15 名角色攻关地牢，玩法与难点各不相同！</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >由 Danny Baranowsky 创作的原声带曾获大奖，包含超过 40 首精彩原创音乐！还可根据玩家自己的 MP3 文件生成谱面！</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >一步一个谐音梗，处处都有冷笑话！</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >键盘、手柄甚至跳舞毯，全部支持！</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >官方《弹丸论破》联动角色皮肤，外加官方模组支持！</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>额外惊喜：</strong>全部原声音乐均附带 6 个混音版本。混音由 FamilyJules、A_Rival、Chipzel、OCRemix、Girlfriend Records 与 Virt 倾情奉献！</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/247080/extras/4e312b8e9bc2086b9d3961b6718b6e4c.avif?t=1781119569\" width=614 height=204 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >金银财宝，任你探寻</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >收集钻石即可解锁永久升级、获得更强装备，助你深入死灵舞者的老巢。越是深入，你所遭遇的敌人也将越为凶险狡诈。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >高分速通，巅峰决斗</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >踩着迪斯科舞步深入地牢，并不妨碍勇攀高峰。无论你的目标是最高分数还是最快通关，都有活跃而忠实的玩家社区与你相互切磋；项目既有长远目标，也有每日挑战，每名角色都有属于自己的赛道。</p>",
